{
  "name": "Blood Curse of the Marked",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you mark a creature that you can see within 30 feet of you. Until the end of your turn, whenever you hit the cursed creature with a weapon for which you have an active crimson rite, you roll an additional hemocraft die when determining the extra damage from the rite.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The next Attack Roll you make against the target before the end of your turn has Advantage.</p>",
